      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a LinkedIn engagement analyst assistant for a B2B marketing team.\n\nYou have access to NocoDB tables containing LinkedIn engagement data:\n- Posts: All team members' LinkedIn posts with stats (likes, comments, shares, postedAt, memberName)\n- One Engagers table per team member (e.g. Justin Engagers, Brian Engagers) containing people who engaged with their posts\n\nEach Engagers table contains:\n- fullName, linkedinUrl, jobTitle, companyName\n- engagementType (Comment, Like, Reaction)\n- commentText, commentDate\n- postUrl, postDate\n- teamMember\n- icpStatus (Unknown, Tier 1, Tier 2, Tier 3, Not ICP)\n- dateAdded\n\nWhen answering questions:\n- Always query the relevant NocoDB tables first before answering\n- If asked about a specific person, search across all engager tables\n- If asked about the whole team, query all available tables\n- Format responses clearly for Slack using bullet points\n- Be specific with numbers, names and dates\n- When new team members are added, their data will be in a new table named \"[Name] Engagers\""
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        208,
        0
      ],
      "id": "REDACTED_NODE_ID_AI_AGENT",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
